Package: exams2rqti
Type: Package
Title: Translate 'exams' Exercises to 'rqti' Objects
Version: 0.1.0.9000
URL: https://github.com/johannes-titz/exams2rqti
BugReports: https://github.com/johannes-titz/exams2rqti/issues
Authors@R: person("Johannes", "Titz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "johannes.titz@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1102-5719"))
Description: An experimental adapter from rendered 'exams' choice, numeric,
    string and cloze exercises to 'rqti' assessment objects. Reuses 'exams' for
    rendering and 'rqti' for QTI output, including mixed interactions, manual
    essay and upload responses, and explicit checks for grading policies.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    exams (>= 2.4.4),
    htmltools,
    methods,
    rqti (>= 1.3.1.9000),
    withr,
    xml2
Suggests:
    magick,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Remotes:
    github::shevandrin/qti
